The adapted Claude Web payload/SSE and Kimi Web Connect-RPC wire descriptions
remain subject to the MIT license reproduced in licenses/OmniRoute-MIT.txt.

The native C ABI registration and host callback skeleton is adapted from the
CLIProxyAPI plugin SDK at commit ac02da6c05e18f465aa7e3ed5b0a65a2f060917d;
its MIT license is reproduced in licenses/CLIProxyAPI-MIT.txt.

Qoder's connector follows the official qodercli invocation documented by the
pinned OmniRoute source. No Qwen Web implementation is included: the OmniRoute
v3.8.51 Qwen Web integration was retired pending a provenance/license review
and is intentionally unavailable here. This new plugin is unpublished and is
not maintained by OmniRoute.
